[189.197955,"o","\u001b[H\u001b[2J\r\n  Real attribution, bounded growth, unchanged daemon\r\n  ==================================================\r\n\r\n  The same eBPF interface accounted for a small baseline and a burst,\r\n  identified its source and TCP port, then stopped growing after the\r\n  senders stopped. No counter reset stood in for recovery.\r\n\r\n  The shown Ze process keeps its PID throughout.\r\n"]
